R-PX2 R-RG7 R-TF4 R-EC19 R-SO13 (slice 206g, Design Q561): the proxy needs the compiler list (rank 4: p2 has the range >=nightly-2026-10-17 and no compiler is installed) and `registry = "ftp://bad"` in config.toml (row 6 of R-RG7). The proxy cannot pick the source of the list: exit 19 with the message of R-RG7 row 6 (the text of registry/rg7-remove-bad-config), no request, no prompt, no install, the compiler does not run. The call order up to the check (the same as cv1-proxy-range up to the first list read) is a reading of the test agent: only the point of the check is the list read.
